  "short_description": "《Wish Upon A Llama》是一款為動物愛好者量身打造的溫馨生活模擬RPG！作為羊駝鎮的新任牧場主，你將培育並照料這些毛茸茸的可愛夥伴，重新找回小鎮與動物之間那份快被遺忘的羈絆。和鎮上的居民慢慢熟悉起來，交一群知心好友，說不定還能遇上一段心動的戀情。冒險，就在前方等著你！",
  "short_description_en": "Wish Upon A Llama is a cozy life sim RPG for animal lovers! As Llama Town's rancher, breed and raise adorable furry friends while rekindling a forgotten bond between the community and animals. Get to know the townsfolk, build lasting friendships, and perhaps discover romance. Adventure awaits!",
